    "description":  "Storn Crag-Strider suggests seeking the Telvanni wizard Neloth, who may know the location of a Black Book connected to Miraak\u0027s power. Neloth reveals that a Black Book lies sealed in a Dwemer protective case in the ruins of Nchardak, and together you must restore the ancient steam systems to release it.",
